# magi — the audio host and the robot's home: nemotron-asr (STT +
# streaming sortformer diarization), kokoro-tts, tls-proxy for the panel.
# Intent routing runs on shodan's Qwen engine (19/20 on the routing
# battery vs phi-3's 14/20, and faster — prefix caching absorbs the
# constant router prompt), so magi runs no LLM at all.
#
# Bring-up: cd deploy/stack && cat .env ../profiles/magi.env > envfile-merged \
#           && docker compose --env-file envfile-merged up -d
COMPOSE_PROFILES=magi
